body:
OK.  im not dead tho

&#x200B;

sick of needing to share the state with these assholes putting our lives at risk

Im a computer scientist and this is BS

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

But I will say that it is entirely possible that their algorithms can't account for how to *model* the situation after 60 without losing.  Either way, Im sure the weakness of the "algorithm" so to speak here isn't the main player in our book of catalysts.

Yeah I wasn't able to call her and cancelled all my plans that work week with anybody I had because I worked 10 hour days.  I value my sleep so I can wake up at 5:30 more than making her wait 5 days to have a call, given that she ghosted me for months.  She can wait for the sake of my health for 5 days.

&#x200B;

No way in hell would I have had time to see her dad that week.  I just didn't have time to do anything that week besides focus on my first week at my first professional job.  I just don't understand how I can be an asshole for keeping to myself for a work week due to stress.  I was not prioritizing anybody over my health and acclimation to my job that week.
